{{/each}}

## Attachments

Upload the following files:

- `complaint.pdf`
{{#each evidenceFiles}}
- `evidence/{{this}}`
{{/each}}

Maximum total size: {{dpa.form.maxTotalAttachmentMB}} MB.
Accepted formats: {{join dpa.form.attachmentsAccepted ", "}}.

